OL,3,GNEWSABus services disrupted as 24-hour
OL,4,Astrike begins
OL,5,
OL,6,FBus services across Cornwall are being
OL,7,Fdisrupted as employees have begun a
OL,8,F24-hour strike.
OL,10,FThe RMT union said members at Go
OL,11,FCornwall were striking over the refusal
OL,12,Fof the company to recognise the union.
OL,14,FEddie Dempsey, RMT general secretary,
OL,15,Fsaid: "It is time Go Cornwall respected
OL,16,Fthe democratic choice of the whole
OL,17,Fworkforce by creating a united
OL,18,Fbargaining structure that genuinely
OL,19,Fprotects every driver and depot
OL,20,Fworker."
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
