OL,3,GNEWSABus services disrupted as 24-hour
OL,4,Astrike begins
OL,5,
OL,6,FGo Cornwall Bus managing director
OL,7,FRichard Stevens said the company
OL,8,Frespected the right of colleagues to
OL,9,Fchoose a union but it noted 199
OL,10,Femployees were taking part in the
OL,11,Fstrike out of 1,041 people employed,
OL,12,Fand about 600 staff were members of the
OL,13,FUnite union.
